{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1000_404apr", "source_sha256": "d8fae28907dd984bd0a23d485c17a365d55b54fe0882ef44a29d4c103028e7d6", "ja": "（今回の公演が終わった。メインアクトの育達は、\n素晴らしいパフォーマンスを見せてくれたな！）", "zh": "（这次公演结束了。育她们作为主角，给大家带来了一场精彩的表演啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "6d4dbf90570746fd323eacbc82240ead91ee39361b7116774db5613487090318", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！　今日のライブ、どうだった？\nお客さん、楽しんでくれてたかな……？", "zh": "制作人先生！今天的演出怎么样？\n客人们玩得开心吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1002_404apr", "source_sha256": "38aa31063ad0a7e2fb927e2df2c35a70016bc85ee4f8a198247beeea78dc3472", "ja": "お疲れさま、育！　もちろんだ。お客さんみんな、\nすごく楽しそうで、最高のライブだったぞ～。", "zh": "辛苦了，育！当然了。客人们看起来都特别开心，是场最棒的演出哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "a8c7f99b270e7b18dafc9d9c7970e939de3787eaa7686018a4ebdf13e75a805b", "ja": "ほんとう？　よかったぁ！", "zh": "真的吗？太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "b94e933e0c7678ad9888217a913c7f5f10877274d37ff59a0e23160bc8735f10", "ja": "わたし、今日は絶対、\n一番になりたいって思ってたけど……。", "zh": "我今天本来想着，无论如何都要拿第一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "a36d113fadf491c798860ba278ea18fc8119207d445b43b8555858128a5156fa", "ja": "でもその前に、\nお客さんが楽しくなかったらダメだもんね？", "zh": "不过在那之前，要是客人们没能开心起来，也不行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1006_404apr", "source_sha256": "6cf513bf0e1e817fc7d490554148861cf2c6343867e554f9045a1315fea621a2", "ja": "そうか。環や桃子との競争だけじゃなく、ちゃんと\nお客さんの事も考えてたんだな。えらいぞ～、育。", "zh": "这样啊。不只是和环、桃子的竞争，你也有认真考虑客人的感受啊。真棒～，育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "ef2f902cbefc844248267db3d6bf40659f630534272cf8610feab479f0581043", "ja": "えへへ……。\nあ、でも、わたしがえらいんじゃなくて。", "zh": "嘿嘿……  \n啊，不过并不是我很棒啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "7b6a569a84a4d3b4da6ba8592d9cd05864b8d61fbfaaf518db661f65e889375e", "ja": "桃子ちゃんが教えてくれたことを、\n思い出したんだよ。", "zh": "我想起了桃子教给我的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1009_404apr", "source_sha256": "4c198919666e00d5ef20e8aafd6aba7060a3f8a2988d228a2cb0341200a1186a", "ja": "桃子が教えてくれた事……？", "zh": "桃子教给我的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "0e503928e0ed9f3065f132fc82747e5925c78d2162f8a7b3cc1d8a812b877205", "ja": "わたし、初めてのステージで……\n終わったあと泣いちゃったの、覚えてる？", "zh": "我第一次登台表演的时候……\n结束后哭了出来，你还记得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "e565c46a8c1742024f89386284104285a332327eed9c733715b69cd1fa90b8c4", "ja": "そうしたら桃子ちゃんが、「プロでしょ、\n自分で判断しないといけないよ」って言ったの。", "zh": "于是桃子对我说：“你可是专业人士吧，得自己做判断才行。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1012_404apr", "source_sha256": "fd2217be6abc883e6d4316cb7d4bcb553f60e3ade2ce205ea2fd8904a3689a4b", "ja": "そんな事もあったな～。デビューしたばかりの育には、\n厳しい言葉だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "还有过这种事啊～。对刚出道的育来说，我觉得那是句挺严厉的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "fecb1e80f9962397e8eeaba7950dc78152b4365e72abcef4aec245bdbdd25797", "ja": "うん。その時は、わたしも\nよくわからなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。虽然那时候，我其实\n也太明白就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "0c52cadd5bc742e290892d50be13e66619ce6fc4064a9634b93689f59c2787d0", "ja": "あとになって、そのとおりだなって。\n桃子ちゃんはすごいなって思ったんだ。", "zh": "后来我觉得，确实是这样。\n桃子真厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1015_404apr", "source_sha256": "6d347cc634078477d490b9209c638500763182d96ec487368acc25b61de0d654", "ja": "そうか～。だから今日は、自分の事じゃなくて、\nお客さん達の事を聞いたのか？", "zh": "这样啊～所以今天，你问的不是自己的事，而是客人们的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "0084b66eede2590273ea61067140cda5d10598e33db6a9c8d01301d019db2e20", "ja": "うん。わたし、がんばったから！\nでも、お客さんはどうだったかなって……。", "zh": "嗯。因为我已经努力过了！\n不过，我也在想观众们到底觉得怎么样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "258b31290d98e68d0a1a48e1c50124d7c74076227c0a58fbf37f83b6e68d1121", "ja": "それにね、桃子ちゃんがきびしいことを言うのは、\nわたしのことを考えてくれてるからだと思うんだ。", "zh": "而且啊，我觉得桃子对我说那些严厉的话，也是因为她在为我着想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "acaa3e6d62f6ba393a26067ed9e32e7e643e43f5071b8898347f2fa44f0fc0e7", "ja": "環ちゃんも、わたしや桃子ちゃんのこと、\nたくさんたくさん、応援してくれるでしょ？", "zh": "小环也会一直一直为我和桃子加油，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "fc813c81e9bdf5d42c74b62495885c9967a809405ce686e56e32b25b016edf99", "ja": "だからわたしも、ふたりみたいにがんばりたい。\n追いつきたいって、あの時からずっと思ってるの……。", "zh": "所以，我也想像你们两个一样努力。想要追上你们，从那时候起我就一直这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1020_404apr", "source_sha256": "4df1efdd3af6c500ebd003637975d117e93dce0f5148947a5a3074d2010c6908", "ja": "うん。その気持ちがあれば、育はきっと、\nすごいアイドルに成長できると思うぞ～。", "zh": "嗯。只要有这份心情，育就一定\n能成长为一名非常厉害的偶像哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "3ecbfbe8ad7897ed4a9bd204388dbdc36296e29f6ca905d2c814c55c037526bf", "ja": "ほんとう？\nありがとう、プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "真的吗？\n谢谢你，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0434_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0434_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "88e4d057b6e9787e2593638cd3b13245a57b605acc573d49c479337ed89156da", "ja": "わたし、がんばる！\nだから……これからも、よろしくね♪　えへへ……。", "zh": "我会努力的！\n所以……今后也请多多关照啦♪　嘿嘿……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
